{
  "name": "Systembrief — Produce Topic",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Produce Topic\n\nBaut **ein** Briefing auf dem Studio-Rechner (self-hosted n8n).\n\nWebhook `POST /webhook/systembrief-produce`\n```json\n{ \"slug\": \"mein-thema\", \"skip_build\": false, \"skip_publish\": false, \"privacy\": \"private\" }\n```\nLeerer `slug` → nächstes Queue-Item.\n\nYouTube-Quota blockiert **nicht** die Site.\nContent (ANALYSE/SKRIPT/Folien) muss schon liegen — sonst `content_missing`.\n\nEnv: `SYSTEMBRIEF_PIPELINE_ROOT`, optional Notify + Webhook-Secret.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "note-produce",
      "name": "Hinweis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [40, 160]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "systembrief-produce",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "hook-produce",
      "name": "Webhook Produce",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [480, 200],
      "webhookId": "systembrief-produce"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "manual-produce",
      "name": "Manuell",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [480, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const secret = $env.SYSTEMBRIEF_WEBHOOK_SECRET;\nconst item = $input.first().json || {};\nconst headers = item.headers || {};\nconst body = item.body || item;\nconst got = headers['x-systembrief-secret'] || headers['X-Systembrief-Secret'];\nif (secret && $node.name === 'Webhook Produce' && got !== secret) {\n  throw new Error('Unauthorized webhook');\n}\nconst slug = (body.slug || item.slug || '').toString().trim();\nconst skipBuild = Boolean(body.skip_build || item.skip_build);\nconst skipPublish = Boolean(body.skip_publish || item.skip_publish);\nconst privacy = (body.privacy || item.privacy || 'private').toString();\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    slug,\n    skip_build: skipBuild,\n    skip_publish: skipPublish,\n    privacy: ['private', 'unlisted', 'public'].includes(privacy) ? privacy : 'private'\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-normalize-produce",
      "name": "Input normalisieren",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [720, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "command": "=powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"{{ $env.SYSTEMBRIEF_PIPELINE_ROOT }}\\scripts\\n8n-pipeline.ps1\" -Action produce -Topic \"{{ $json.slug }}\" -Privacy \"{{ $json.privacy }}\" -SkipBuild:{{ $json.skip_build || false }} -SkipPublish:{{ $json.skip_publish || false }}",
        "executeOnce": true
      },
      "id": "exec-produce",
      "name": "Pipeline produce",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeCommand",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [960, 300],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "function parseResult(item) {\n  const stdout = item.stdout || item.json?.stdout || '';\n  const line = String(stdout).split(/\\r?\\n/).reverse().find(l => l.startsWith('N8N_RESULT=')) || '';\n  if (!line) {\n    return {\n      ok: false,\n      reason: 'no_n8n_result',\n      exitCode: item.exitCode ?? item.json?.exitCode,\n      stderr: item.stderr || item.json?.stderr || '',\n      stdout: String(stdout).slice(-4000)\n    };\n  }\n  return JSON.parse(line.slice('N8N_RESULT='.length));\n}\nconst raw = $input.first().json || {};\nconst report = parseResult(raw);\nreturn [{ json: report }];"
      },
      "id": "code-parse-produce",
      "name": "Ergebnis parsen",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1200, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "content-missing",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.reason }}",
              "rightValue": "content_missing",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-content-missing",
      "name": "Content fehlt?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "msg",
              "name": "operator_message",
              "value": "={{ 'Content fehlt für ' + ($json.topic || '(kein slug)') + ': ' + (($json.content && $json.content.missing) || []).join(', ') + '. ANALYSE.md, SKRIPT.md, slides_narration.json, presentation.js schreiben, dann Webhook erneut.' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-missing-msg",
      "name": "Operator-Hinweis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [1680, 180]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-notify",
              "leftValue": "={{ $env.SYSTEMBRIEF_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "if-notify-produce",
      "name": "Notify gesetzt?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1920, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SYSTEMBRIEF_NOTIFY_WEBHOOK }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ text: ($json.ok ? ('Systembrief produce ok: ' + ($json.topic || '')) : ('Systembrief produce: ' + ($json.operator_message || $json.reason || $json.error || 'Fehler'))), report: $json }) }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "responseFormat": "text"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-notify-produce",
      "name": "Notify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2160, 200]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
